            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe the delayed diagnosis and management of a spinal headache following the use of a 24 g Sprotte needle, the results of a survey of spinal needle usage by physicians in the south west of England and a review of the prevention and management of postdural puncture headache.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
